* DSNCRCT: hand-written fixture (#5154), syntax per IBM CICS TS for OS/390 R3 Resource Definition Guide
* SC33-1684-30 ch.13 p.419-432 (DSNCRCT TYPE=INIT|COMD|POOL|ENTRY|GROUP|FINAL).
DSNCRCT  CSECT
         DSNCRCT TYPE=INIT,SUFFIX=01,SUBID=DB2P,PLANI=BANKPLN
         DSNCRCT TYPE=COMD,AUTH=USERID,THRDM=1,THRDA=1
         DSNCRCT TYPE=POOL,PLAN=BANKPOOL,THRDM=3,THRDA=3
         DSNCRCT TYPE=GROUP,GROUP=BANKDB2
         DSNCRCT TYPE=ENTRY,TXID=(BA01),PLAN=BANKINQP,THRDA=4
         DSNCRCT TYPE=ENTRY,TXID=(BA02,BA03),THRDA=2,TWAIT=YES
         DSNCRCT TYPE=FINAL
         END
